cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "NeuroUrbanism-DB: a living database of EEG studies on architecture, urbanism, and nature"
message: "If you use this database, please cite the specific Zenodo-minted version DOI listed in the README."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Zander
    given-names: Roy
    affiliation: "Zander Labs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Randomidous/NeuroUrbanism-DB"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - EEG
  - neuroscience
  - architecture
  - urbanism
  - nature
  - biophilic design
  - systematic review
abstract: >-
  Curated, openly accessible database of empirical EEG studies investigating
  human neurophysiological responses to architectural, urban, and natural
  environments. Records include citation, sample, paradigm, EEG acquisition
  setup, analysis approach, mobility scoring, and replicability assessment.
